# Build context exclusions.
#
# Keeping node_modules and .env out matters twice over: the image would
# otherwise carry host-built native modules and, worse, bake real secrets into
# a layer that anyone who pulls the image can read back.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
.claude
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Docs and assets not needed at runtime
*.md
!README.md
ER_DIAGRAM.png
load-tests
